Modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
---------------------------------------

The sources are functionally unmodified. Two packaging changes were applied
when the component was vendored:

  * file extensions were changed from the upstream .h / .cc to .hpp / .cpp, to
    match this tree's build rules;
  * the upstream "highwayhash/" include prefix was dropped, so the files
    include each other by bare name (e.g. #include "arch_specific.hpp"
    rather than #include "highwayhash/arch_specific.h").

No OmniSim- or Webots-specific code was introduced into any of these files.


Unresolved
----------

  * The exact upstream commit is not recorded anywhere in this directory.
    ./Readme.md pins only "github master as of 2017.04.24", so the vendored
    revision cannot be identified to a SHA from the evidence on hand.
  * The vendoring predates this repository's history for this path: the only
    commit touching it here is 7692944e7, the src/webots -> src/omnisim
    directory rename. The component was inherited from upstream Webots.
  * ./LICENSE is the verbatim Apache-2.0 text, and its closing "APPENDIX: How
    to apply the Apache License to your work" section still reads
    "Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright owner]". That is deliberate and must
    stay: the appendix is part of the licence's own canonical wording -- it is
